@startuml
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "学生客户端 (Vue 3)" as student

box "业务层 (启发式代码评测数据流与类图联动)" #LightBlue
participant "JudgeController\n<<REST API 入口>>" as controller
participant "ASTParser\n<<白盒引擎>>" as ast
participant "SandboxExecutor\n<<黑盒服务>>" as sandbox
participant "PromptBuilder\n<<上下文拼接>>" as prompt
participant "LLMScheduler\n<<推流客户端>>" as llm
end box

student -> controller: 1. SubmitCodeCommand(code, task_id)
activate controller

controller -> ast: 2. 发起静态语法树解析(code)
activate ast
note right of ast: 递归调用重写方法\nvisit_For() / visit_If()\n生成规约圈复杂度
ast --> controller: 3. 返回 AnalysisReport 结果载荷
deactivate ast

alt 语法通过并允许执行
    controller -> sandbox: 4. 送入受限沙箱运行
    activate sandbox
    note right of sandbox: 隔离网络/磁盘读写\n执行断言与边界检验
    sandbox --> controller: 5. 抛出执行结果与 Traceback
    deactivate sandbox

    controller -> prompt: 6. 整合静态诊断与动态黑盒错误
    activate prompt
    note right of prompt: 运用“苏格拉底原则”\n拼凑不给代码只给启发的 Prompt
    prompt --> controller: 7. 输出格式化的引导文本
    deactivate prompt
    
    controller -> llm: 8. 请求大模型推理(Prompt_Ready)
    activate llm
    llm --> controller: 9. 开启流式 SSE 长连接
    deactivate llm

    controller --> student: 10. 持续下推数据 [data: {"token": "xxx"}]
else 存在致命基础语法缺陷 (如缺少冒号/括号缺失)
    controller --> student: 10. 终止流转, 返回 "KEEP_TRYING"\n并提示基础结构修复
end

deactivate controller
@enduml